#: ../Doc/whatsnew/3.8.rst:1905
msgid ""
"A :mod:`dbm.dumb` database opened with flags ``'r'`` is now read-only. :func:"
"`dbm.dumb.open` with flags ``'r'`` and ``'w'`` no longer creates a database "
